                                                "sense_id": "f012ec55-074e-3d46-9c29-6d2eeaa247e6",
                                                "text": "With a stride, the doctor reached the bed, and seizing her arms worked them energetically, applying what I knew to be artificial respiration. He issued a few short sharp orders to the servants."
